These derivative ONNX graphs modify inference operations. The compact
variant also applies dynamic INT8 quantization to acoustic projections.
The English checkpoint was not retrained. See LICENSE for the license text.

The optional dizione frontend and source dictionaries are fetched
separately. They are not distributed with this package. Their source
and license files are linked in the model card.
